  "verse": "You give yourselves free rein in your unknowledge regarding the truth, so you mightfully make room for inequity (unfairness) and unrighteousness (consciencelessness) which is used for waging battle (war) and for killing, in order to practise hatred, revenge and retaliation and to commit all kinds of outrages (acts of Gewalt and crimes).",
